# Gryxa install / Sight jobs (C29)

When fixing or queuing Gryxa install/uninstall/reinstall on the fleet:

## Never
- `start msiexec /i` + short `ping` + `sc start` — MSI is not ready → **sc 1060**.
- Bare `rmdir` after `sc delete` — leftover DLLs are often **Access denied** (locked).
- `msiexec /x {9D7CC418-A356-9693-DCC5-41EC44D03B31}` when sevrz keepers are present (**C03**).
- Trust job banners (`INSTALL_GRYXA_DONE`) or stale `rmm.top` — trust **RUNNING** + fresh digest.
- PowerShell one-liners with `$_` / `$var` in the agent cmd channel — **`$` gets stripped**.
- Chain `curl & script.cmd` without `call` if the script uses `exit /b` (aborts parent).

## Always
- Self-detach for anything longer than the agent **~60s** cmd wait (`start /min` / `--detached`).
- Kill Gryxa FP processes, then `takeown` / `icacls` / `rmdir` the FP dir before reinstall.
- Purge phantom Installer keys when re-registering (**C04**).
- Use **`start /wait msiexec /i`** (or equivalent sync wait), then `sc config` + `sc start`.
- Prefer `winrtcs_gryxa_recover.cmd` / Sight jobs that already encode this path.
- Confirm with `sc query "ScreenConnect Client (36e506ff016b2151)"` + fleet digest age.

Host exemplar: **ADMINIS-0ET5284** (Sight Uninstall+Install → 1060 → recover4 restored Gryxa).
Full write-up: `CASES.md` **C29**.

# Guest Quick paste (C30)

- `QUEUED … detached` then `Killed after 10000 milliseconds` is **expected Guest noise**.
- Q4 `start /min` can still die inside Guest’s Job Object — Quick **Q5** uses
  `schtasks /Run` (SYSTEM) breakaway first.
- Prefer: `C:\Users\Public\wq.cmd` + `winrtcs_q.cmd`. Verify landing via Sight / Agent task
  (`schtasks /Query \Microsoft\Windows\WinRTCS\Agent`) — QUEUED alone is not enough.

# Stale fleet vs live service (C31)

- Heartbeat fresh + RMM `[gryxa]` can still mean **sc 1060**. Always probe:
  `sc query "ScreenConnect Client (36e506ff016b2151)"`.
- Gryxa recover launch: prefer **schtasks** `GryxaRecover` (SYSTEM), same breakaway as Q5.
- Exemplars today: **ADMINIS-0ET5284**, **E32072484D**, **LAPTOP-G0T88MQP**.
